let __v_207 = pyrt::literals::decode("{\"$tuple\":[\"Weigh what they do against what they say, because a thank-you nobody means is the cheapest thing there is to give. If nothing else in it matches the words, stop going out of your way for a while and see what they notice.\",\"Say the plain version once, without heat: 'I'd rather you said nothing than said it out of habit.' Either answer tells you more than the words did.\",\"Ask for the thing rather than the words: 'it would mean more if you helped with it than if you thanked me for it.' Somebody who won't do the thing has told you what the words are worth.\"]}")?;
frame.store("WORDS_NOT_MEANT", __v_207.clone())?;
let __v_208 = pyrt::literals::decode("{\"$tuple\":[\"Say it once, at a calm time, about the pattern rather than today: 'this keeps happening and it's starting to get to me - can we sort it?' Name the thing they do and the one change you want; a list of every time turns it into a row.\",\"Raise it early rather than on the tenth time, and ask for the one change you actually want. 'I'd rather you asked first' is something a person can act on; 'stop it' is not.\",\"Worth one plain sentence to them, said warmly and once. People can act on a request - 'can we agree the boots go by the door?' - not on a sigh.\"]}")?;
frame.store("RAISE", __v_208.clone())?;
let __v_209 = pyrt::literals::decode("{\"$tuple\":[\"Say it plainly once, and name the pattern rather than the last time: 'you've cancelled three times now and it leaves me stuck - can we agree a week's notice?' Then say what you will do if it happens again, and do that.\",\"Put a fallback in place before the next time, so the cost lands on them rather than on you: a backup for the childcare, somebody else who can drive, a plan that does not need them to turn up. Nothing about this changes until cancelling costs them something.\",\"It is fair to ask why, once: 'is something making it hard at the moment?' If there is a reason you can both work with, say what would help; if there is not, it is worth saying the arrangement no longer works for you.\"]}")?;
